  "summary": "Experienced Telecommunications Professional | IT Specialist | Salesforce Developer\n\nWith over 30 years of dedicated service in the telecommunications industry, I bring a wealth of experience and expertise to every project I undertake. My journey began in customer service, where I honed my interpersonal skills and developed a deep understanding of customer needs and expectations.\n\nTransitioning into IT, I've spent the past 25 years immersed in various programming languages and technologies, ranging from C and Informix 4GL to Visual C++, ColdFusion, PHP, JavaScript, and Remedy AR System. Currently, I am focused on custom Salesforce development, leveraging its powerful capabilities to drive efficiency, automation, and innovation within telecom operations.\n\nThroughout my career, I've demonstrated a commitment to excellence and a passion for staying at the forefront of technological advancements. Whether it's crafting custom solutions, optimizing existing systems, or providing strategic guidance, I thrive on the challenges and opportunities that arise in the ever-evolving landscape of telecommunications.\n\nI am eager to connect with like-minded professionals, explore potential collaborations, and contribute to the continued growth and success of the telecommunications industry. Let's connect and explore how we can make an impact together.",
